  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{不正|ふせい}→不正：01660_fusei⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{発覚|はっかく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - misconduct comes to light\n- ⟦{事件|じけん}→事件：01568_jiken⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{発覚|はっかく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - an incident is exposed\n- {発覚|はっかく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{恐|おそ}れる→恐れる：02023_osoreru⟧ - to fear discovery\n- {発覚|はっかく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{免|まぬが}れる→免れる：10548_manugareru⟧ - to escape detection\n\nUSAGE:\nTypically used with the intransitive pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{発覚|はっかく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (X comes to light)\nAlmost always refers to negative things being discovered.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{隠蔽|いんぺい}→隠蔽：07627_inpei⟧ - concealment (what is done before {発覚|はっかく})\n- ⟦{暴露|ばくろ}→暴露：07630_bakuro⟧ - exposure (active revelation by someone)",
